016	NEH	003	015	Kol-Hose babarima Salum a na otua Mispa mansin ano no na osiesiee Asuti Pon no. Osiesiee, bɔɔ so, sisii nʼapon na ɔde nkyerewa bobɔɔ mu, bram no. Afei, osiesiee Siloam abura ho fasu a ɛbɛn ɔhene mfikyifuw no. Ɔsan too ɔfasu no kosii atrapoe a esian fi Dawid kuropɔn mu no.
016	NEH	003	016	Nea ɔtoa ne so yɛ Asbuk babarima Nehemia a na otua Bet-Sur mansin fa ano no. Ɔtoo ɔfasu no kosii faako a na ɛne adehye amusiei no di nhwɛanim, kosi nsukorae no so ne Dɔmmarima Fi.
016	NEH	003	017	Wɔn a wɔtoa so yɛ Lewifo kuw a na wɔhyɛ Bani babarima Rehum ase yɛ adwuma no. Hasabia a na ɔyɛ Keila mansin fa ntuanoni no na osii nʼankasa mansin anan mu hwɛɛ fasu no si so.
