018	JOB	021	001	Na Hiob buae se,
018	JOB	021	002	Muntie me nsɛm no yiye. Momma eyi nyɛ awerɛkyekye a mode ma me.
018	JOB	021	003	Munnya ntoboase mma me bere a merekasa, na sɛ mekasa wie a, monkɔ so nni fɛw.
