019	PSA	128	006	Ɔmma wo ntena ase nhu wo mma mma. Asomdwoe nka Israel.
019	PSA	129	001	Ɔsoroforo dwom. “Wɔahyɛ me so pii afi me mmofraase, ma Israel nka ɛ.
019	PSA	129	002	“Wɔahyɛ me so pii afi me mmofraase, nanso wontumi nnii me so nkonim ɛ.
