019	PSA	132	004	meremma nna mmfa me na meremma mʼani nkum,
019	PSA	132	005	kosi sɛ menya baabi ama Awurade, baabi a nea ɔyɛ Otumfo ma Yakob No bɛtena.”
019	PSA	132	006	Yɛtee wɔ Efrata, yɛbɛtoo so wɔ Yaar mfuw so.
019	PSA	132	007	“Momma yɛnkɔ nʼatenae; momma yɛnsom wɔ ne nan ntiaso hɔ.
