019	PSA	132	010	Wo somfo Dawid nti, nyi wʼani mfi nea woasra no ngo no so.
019	PSA	132	011	Awurade kaa ntam kyerɛɛ Dawid, nokware ntam a ɔntwe nsan se, “Wʼasefo no mu baako na mede no bɛtena wʼahengua so.
019	PSA	132	012	Sɛ wo mmabarima di mʼapam so na wotie me nkyerɛkyerɛ a, ɛno de wɔn mmabarima bɛtena wʼahengua so afebɔɔ.”
