041	MAR	003	004	Ɔdan ne ho kyerɛɛ nʼatamfo no bisaa wɔn se, “Eye sɛ obi yɛ papa Homeda? Anaasɛ ɛyɛ da a wɔde yɛ bɔne? Ɛyɛ da a wɔde gye nkwa anaa wɔma obi nkwa hwere no” Nanso wɔammua no.
041	MAR	003	005	Ɔde abufuw hwɛɛ wɔn hyiae. Ɛhaw no sɛ wonni ahummɔbɔ mma nnipa enti ɔka kyerɛɛ ɔbarima no se, “Teɛ wo nsa no mu.” Ɔteɛɛ mu na amono mu hɔ ara, ne nsa no yɛɛ yiye.
